        <mxCell id="c47" value="&lt;b&gt;A correct failure.&lt;/b&gt; Only the table and the card, the visuals that read Labor Cost, fail. The text box and the Plant page do not: no measure on the Plant page reads the cost, so its cards and charts still show hours: 1.51 hours per standard hour on 101,237 manufacturing hours of the year, 62,764 of them direct." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="596" y="452" width="264" height="119" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
