        <mxCell id="c49" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex B.1, with the bar above the page naming the user and the role Cost Center Managers. The message is the engine&#x27;s, as the model answer&#x27;s note records it; Desktop&#x27;s own wording around it is not verified. Inset: the model answer&#x27;s Plant page, as the book draws it; direct hours by work center add to 62,764 of the 101,237 hours, because indirect time (38,473) has no work center.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="662" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
